      "content": "it's not just that they aren't talking to me, it's that they actually hate me. like, i saw the group chat glance at me in the cafe and then everyone just went silent. it's permanent. there is no \"fixing\" this or making it better. there's just this huge, empty space where my life used to be. i don't see how anyone is supposed to just keep going like this.",
